          "title": "mcli fses",
          "description": "create the fses feature\nfses would be a variation of ses. the idea is that this would however filter by only showing the quick decks configuration that is being used on src\\user_data\\settings.json\n\"quiz_decks_configuration\": {\n\t\t\"masks\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"title\": \"cert-focus\",\n\t\t\t\t\"decks_to_enable\": [\n\t\t\t\t\t\"cfa\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\"datascience-statistics\"\n\t\t\t\t]\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"title\": \"school-focus\",\n\t\t\t\t\"decks_to_enable\": [\n\t\t\t\t\t\"college-algebra\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\"college-engineering\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\"college-digital-systems\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\"college-quimica\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\"college-math-analysis\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\"college-programming\"\n\t\t\t\t]\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t],\n\t\t\"use_masks\": [\n\t\t\t\"school-focus\"\n\t\t]\n\t},\n\nalso 2 random decks\nAlso include how to run to create via the cli masks and toggle use and not use them.",
